                <pb facs="0271" n="221" xml:id="pg221"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Eustis.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-06-29"><hi rendition="#italic">June 29,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>President, Cabinet, Senators, and Members House of Representatives will attend
                    religious service here on Sunday in memory of late President of France.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
